title: The J-space surfaces intermediate (non-output) concepts.
pid: f8acb3a2-2fc0-4945-94c1-76774df77225
body: |2-
  "The J-lens surfaces intermediate steps that never appear in output — spider before "8 legs," the planned rhyme word before the line that leads to it is written, arithmetic intermediates (21 → 42 → 49) appearing at successively later layers in the order the computation requires."
  --Claude
